# Branch m5-league-lost: a loss to the Elite Four blacks out. A constructed
# start (setup lines, no story chain): eight badges, one level-10 Pokémon, $10000, the blackout spawn the League's
# north Pokémon Center (entering it makes it so, as the DS does). The elevator lands in Aaron's room: the on-frame
# script walks the player in and shuts the door behind (FLAG_HIDE_POKEMON_LEAGUE_AARON_ROOM_ENTRANCE_DOOR clear).
# Aaron's battle (261) is lost: CheckWonBattle FALSE → PokemonLeagueAaronRoom_BlackOut → BlackOutFromBattle. The
# player wakes at the north center's counter, the nurse heals the party, the penalty is paid (highest level · 4 ·
# 30 with eight badges: $1200), and Aaron stays undefeated. Headless in tests/integration/m5-league.rom.test.ts.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_BIDOOF 10 platinum:MOVE_TACKLE
set money 10000
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_COAL
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_FOREST
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_COBBLE
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_FEN
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_RELIC
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_MINE
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_ICICLE
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_BEACON
set var platinum:VAR_RIVAL_BEAT_SUNYSHORE_GYM 1
set flag platinum:FLAG_POKEMON_LEAGUE_DOOR_GUARD_MOVED_AWAY true
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_POKEMON_LEAGUE 847 560 up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 11 11 3000
+0 release up
until idle 3000
+0 assert state blackOut "platinum:MAP_HEADER_POKEMON_LEAGUE_NORTH_POKECENTER_1F"
+0 press up
until position 11 2 3000
+0 release up
until idle 3000
# the elevator room: onto the platform lift at 4, 11, which carries the player up to the room's door
+0 press up
until position 4 11 3000
+0 release up
until idle 6000
+0 press up
until position 8 11 6000
+0 release up
until idle 3000
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_POKEMON_LEAGUE_AARON_ROOM 8 9
+0 press up
until position 8 6 3000
+0 release up
until idle 3000
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
battle auto 30000
+0 assert battle trainer platinum:TRAINER_ELITE_FOUR_AARON lost single
until position 4 3 6000
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_POKEMON_LEAGUE_NORTH_POKECENTER_1F 4 3
+0 assert state money 8800
advance text 3000
until idle 3000
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_DEFEATED_AARON false
